#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:35
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nieuwe functies"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Drawing** — added ``image.draw_line()`` / ``draw_rectangle()`` / "
"``draw_circle()`` / ``draw_string()`` / ``draw_cross()`` / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` with keyword arguments (color, thickness, …)."
msgstr ""
"**Tekenen** — ``image.draw_line()`` / ``draw_rectangle()`` / "
"``draw_circle()`` / ``draw_string()`` / ``draw_cross()`` / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` toegevoegd met keyword-argumenten (color, thickness, "
"…)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Binary / morphology** — added ``image.binary()``, ``invert()``, ``and()`` "
"/ ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / ``xor()`` / ``xnor()``, ``erode()`` / "
"``dilate()`` / ``morph()``, ``negate()`` / ``difference()``, ``pixels()``, "
"``centroid()``, ``orientation_radians()`` / ``orientation_degrees()``, and "
"``width()`` / ``height()`` / ``format()``."
msgstr ""
"**Binair / morfologie** — ``image.binary()``\\ , ``invert()``\\ , ``and()`` "
"/ ``nand()`` / ``or()`` / ``nor()`` / ``xor()`` / ``xnor()``\\ , ``erode()``"
" / ``dilate()`` / ``morph()``\\ , ``negate()`` / ``difference()``\\ , "
"``pixels()``\\ , ``centroid()``\\ , ``orientation_radians()`` / "
"``orientation_degrees()`` en ``width()`` / ``height()`` / ``format()`` "
"toegevoegd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Keypoints / descriptors** — FAST keypoint extraction via "
"``find_keypoints()``, a unified ``match_descriptor()`` and "
"``save_descriptor()`` / ``load_descriptor()`` for FREAK / LBP, plus a "
"profile-face Haar/LBP cascade."
msgstr ""
"**Keypoints / descriptors** — FAST-keypointextractie via "
"``find_keypoints()``\\ , een uniforme ``match_descriptor()`` en "
"``save_descriptor()`` / ``load_descriptor()`` voor FREAK / LBP, plus een "
"profiel-gezicht Haar/LBP-cascade."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Color / statistics** — :class:`image.statistics` and color-conversion "
"functions (``rgb_to_lab`` / ``lab_to_rgb`` / ``rgb_to_grayscale`` / "
"``grayscale_to_rgb``)."
msgstr ""
"**Kleur / statistieken** — :class:`image.statistics` en "
"kleurconversiefuncties (\\ ``rgb_to_lab`` / ``lab_to_rgb`` / "
"``rgb_to_grayscale`` / ``grayscale_to_rgb``\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:52
msgid ""
"**File I/O** — BMP / PPM (P2/P3/P5/P6) / JPEG load and save (including "
"grayscale JPEG and 4:2:0 / 4:2:2 chroma subsampling)."
msgstr ""
"**Bestands-I/O** — BMP / PPM (P2/P3/P5/P6) / JPEG laden en opslaan "
"(inclusief grijswaarden-JPEG en 4:2:0 / 4:2:2 chroma-subsampling)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Modules** — new ``lcd`` (LCD shield), :mod:`mjpeg` (video recording), "
"color :mod:`gif` (with ``Gif.loop()``), and ``mlx`` thermal-camera modules, "
"each with example scripts."
msgstr ""
"**Modules** — nieuwe ``lcd`` (LCD-shield), :mod:`mjpeg` (video-opname), "
"kleur-\\ :mod:`gif` (met ``Gif.loop()``\\ ), en ``mlx`` thermische-"
"cameramodules, elk met voorbeeldscripts."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — added :func:`sensor.get_id` (+ OV9650/OV2640/OV7725 PID "
"constants), :func:`sensor.set_special_effect` (SDE_* constants), "
"``sensor.set_image_filter()`` (FILTER_BW / FILTER_SKIN), the ``HQVGA`` "
"framesize, and ``image.set_pixel(x, y, …)``."
msgstr ""
"**Sensor** — :func:`sensor.get_id` toegevoegd (+ OV9650/OV2640/OV7725 PID-"
"constanten), :func:`sensor.set_special_effect` (SDE_*-constanten), "
"``sensor.set_image_filter()`` (FILTER_BW / FILTER_SKIN), de ``HQVGA``\\ "
"-framesize en ``image.set_pixel(x, y, …)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:61
msgid ""
"**WiFi** — added the ATWINC1500 WiFi driver and OpenMV 1/2 BSP groundwork, "
"plus a BLE example."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi** — de ATWINC1500 WiFi-driver en het OpenMV 1/2 BSP-fundament "
"toegevoegd, plus een BLE-voorbeeld."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:65
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Overige wijzigingen en verbeteringen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:67
msgid ""
"The framebuffer is now JPEG-compressed before streaming to OpenMV IDE (lower"
" bandwidth); JPEG compression is done in place; OV7725 H/V zoom enables "
"arbitrary scaling; improved (faster) Haar face detection that runs at QVGA."
msgstr ""
"De framebuffer wordt nu JPEG-gecomprimeerd voordat hij naar OpenMV IDE wordt"
" gestreamd (lagere bandbreedte); JPEG-compressie gebeurt in-place; OV7725 "
"H/V-zoom maakt willekeurige schaling mogelijk; verbeterde (snellere) Haar-"
"gezichtsdetectie die op QVGA draait."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:73
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Bugfixes"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:75
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "Imaging:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:77
msgid ""
"Fixed the integral-image computation, ``median()`` filter corruption, the "
"centroid computation, RGB skin / black-and-white filters on RGB input, and "
"faster grayscale BMP/PPM read/write."
msgstr ""
"De integral-image-berekening, corruptie van het ``median()``\\ -filter, de "
"centroid-berekening, RGB-huid- / zwart-witfilters op RGB-invoer "
"gecorrigeerd, en snellere grijswaarden-BMP/PPM-lees/-schrijfbewerkingen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:81
msgid "Sensor and system:"
msgstr "Sensor en systeem:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:83
msgid ""
"Fixed the :class:`pyb.Servo` timers (Servo now works), HQVGA resolution, SD-"
"card init reliability, re-initializing storage after a soft-reset, and re-"
"running the REPL when no script is present."
msgstr ""
"De :class:`pyb.Servo`\\ -timers gecorrigeerd (Servo werkt nu), HQVGA-"
"resolutie, betrouwbaarheid van SD-kaartinitialisatie, herinitialisatie van "
"opslag na een soft-reset, en het opnieuw uitvoeren van de REPL wanneer er "
"geen script aanwezig is."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:88
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware- en boardondersteuning"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:90
msgid "**OV7725** camera sensor."
msgstr "**OV7725**\\ -camerasensor."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:91
msgid ""
"**LCD shield** (``lcd`` module), ``mlx`` thermal camera, and **ATWINC1500** "
"WiFi groundwork."
msgstr ""
"**LCD-shield** (\\ ``lcd``\\ -module), ``mlx`` thermische camera, en "
"**ATWINC1500** WiFi-fundament."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:95
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Breaking API-wijzigingen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:97
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v1.1.0 and v1.2.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Voor gebruikers zichtbare API-breaks tussen v1.1.0 en v1.2.0. Bereik: Python"
" C-modules in ``modules/`` en Python-bibliotheken in "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:100
msgid ""
"All three breaking changes are *behavior* changes to core :mod:`sensor` "
"functions (same API, different behavior) — re-check affected scripts. Each "
"commit hash links to its diff on GitHub. (The vast majority of this release "
"is new API built out within the v1.1→v1.2 range and is therefore additive, "
"not breaking.)"
msgstr ""
"Alle drie de breaking changes zijn *gedrags*\\ wijzigingen in kern-\\ "
":mod:`sensor`\\ -functies (zelfde API, ander gedrag) — controleer "
"betreffende scripts opnieuw. Elke commit-hash linkt naar zijn diff op "
"GitHub. (Het overgrote deel van deze release is nieuwe API die binnen het "
"bereik v1.1→v1.2 is uitgebouwd en is dus additief, niet breaking.)"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:109
msgid ":func:`sensor.reset` no longer applies a default config *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.reset` past geen standaardconfiguratie meer toe *(gedrag)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:111
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.reset` no longer applies a built-in default configuration "
"(pixformat / framesize / framerate / gain / contrast / brightness / "
"saturation). Scripts that relied on ``reset()`` leaving a usable default "
"must now explicitly call :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` and "
":func:`sensor.set_framesize` (and any other settings) after ``reset()``."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.reset` past niet langer een ingebouwde standaardconfiguratie "
"toe (pixformat / framesize / framerate / gain / contrast / brightness / "
"saturation). Scripts die erop vertrouwden dat ``reset()`` een bruikbare "
"standaardinstelling achterliet, moeten nu expliciet "
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` en :func:`sensor.set_framesize` aanroepen (en "
"eventuele andere instellingen) na ``reset()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `d1e782df3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d1e782df3>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `d1e782df3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d1e782df3>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:122
msgid ":func:`sensor.snapshot` raises on timeout *(behavior)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.snapshot` gooit een uitzondering bij timeout *(gedrag)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:124
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.snapshot` now raises ``RuntimeError(\"Sensor Timeout!!\")`` "
"when the sensor times out instead of hanging indefinitely. Wrap "
"``snapshot()`` in ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` if you need to tolerate "
"timeouts."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.snapshot` gooit nu ``RuntimeError(\"Sensor Timeout!!\")`` "
"wanneer de sensor een timeout krijgt, in plaats van oneindig te blijven "
"hangen. Wikkel ``snapshot()`` in ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` als je "
"timeouts moet kunnen tolereren."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:128
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `e3f41d674 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e3f41d674>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `e3f41d674 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e3f41d674>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:133
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` raises on unsupported format *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` gooit een uitzondering bij niet-ondersteund "
"formaat *(gedrag)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:135
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` now raises an exception when given an "
"unsupported pixel format instead of returning ``False``. Code that checked "
"the ``False`` return must catch the exception instead."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` gooit nu een uitzondering wanneer een niet-"
"ondersteund pixelformaat wordt opgegeven, in plaats van ``False`` terug te "
"geven. Code die de ``False``\\ -retourwaarde controleerde, moet in plaats "
"daarvan de uitzondering opvangen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:139
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `e0c5822c2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e0c5822c2>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `e0c5822c2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e0c5822c2>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:144
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migratiechecklist"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:146
msgid "For a clean port to v1.2.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Voor een schone overstap naar v1.2.0 is het typische werk:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:148
msgid ""
"Explicitly set :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` / :func:`sensor.set_framesize` "
"after :func:`sensor.reset` (:ref:`the reset change <v1_2_0_reset>`)."
msgstr ""
"Stel expliciet :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` / :func:`sensor.set_framesize` "
"in na :func:`sensor.reset` (\\ :ref:`de reset-wijziging <v1_2_0_reset>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:150
msgid ""
"Wrap :func:`sensor.snapshot` in ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` if you "
"need to tolerate sensor timeouts (:ref:`the snapshot change "
"<v1_2_0_snapshot>`)."
msgstr ""
"Wikkel :func:`sensor.snapshot` in ``try`` / ``except RuntimeError`` als je "
"sensortimeouts moet kunnen tolereren (\\ :ref:`de snapshot-wijziging "
"<v1_2_0_snapshot>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:153
msgid ""
"Catch the exception from :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` instead of checking "
"for ``False`` (:ref:`the set_pixformat change <v1_2_0_setpixformat>`)."
msgstr ""
"Vang de uitzondering van :func:`sensor.set_pixformat` op in plaats van te "
"controleren op ``False`` (\\ :ref:`de set_pixformat-wijziging "
"<v1_2_0_setpixformat>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.2.0.rst:156
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Alle andere scripts draaien ongewijzigd."
